# Code owners for Openfund.
#
# Openfund currently has exactly one maintainer with write access
# (@algomanlife). Every path below therefore names that account; no reviewer is
# invented. GitHub never requests a review from the pull request author, so
# while there is one maintainer this file documents ownership and routes review
# requests from outside contributors. "Require review from Code Owners" is NOT
# enabled, because it would block the sole maintainer's own pull requests. See
# docs/development/REPOSITORY_GOVERNANCE.md ("Review authority").
#
# When a second qualified maintainer joins, add them to the relevant lines and
# enable code-owner review in the main-branch ruleset. Later lines take
# precedence over earlier ones.

# Default owner for everything not listed below.
*                                       @algomanlife

